    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/05646863feb6da49d5eda84ce5a07113.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living your life as an unemployed bum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing the SATs, you're holded up in the corner of your room wasting time watching anime and playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you are suddenly forced to move out to a sharehouse in Seoul by your parents,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come into an unexpected encounter with three housemates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the only problem is that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are all girls???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/28dc78280de46fb5b1ec44f83eda3721.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/58991453d6bb7ad229256ada78d089c5.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/25063a1f18e0220aab3587bf1fbceb66.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=667 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Story of our life]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Welcome, Sharehouse!&quot; is a comedic look at the struggles of 20-somethings in the modern world. As you  move in together with these three housemates... together, you try to figure out on what to do in the future along side with your partners.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[High-quality illustrations].</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The illustrations are drawn in great detail, focusing on the points that you will find appealing. Enjoy what it's like to live with these cute characters!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Intuitive interface to make gaming easier and more enjoyable].</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To make the game as easy and appealing as possible, we've designed the interface to be as intuitive and user-friendly as possible, so you and your roommates can focus on your romance with the characters.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/c9b34c34c6e7765dc449666260f5083d.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/f9b6a85211949e98df84ad6085c2fa5a.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/8b97a52f8c42764e48736f7f3faa5fa2.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/05646863feb6da49d5eda84ce5a07113.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living your life as an unemployed bum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing the SATs, you're holded up in the corner of your room wasting time watching anime and playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you are suddenly forced to move out to a sharehouse in Seoul by your parents,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come into an unexpected encounter with three housemates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the only problem is that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are all girls???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/28dc78280de46fb5b1ec44f83eda3721.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/58991453d6bb7ad229256ada78d089c5.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/25063a1f18e0220aab3587bf1fbceb66.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=667 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Story of our life]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Welcome, Sharehouse!&quot; is a comedic look at the struggles of 20-somethings in the modern world. As you  move in together with these three housemates... together, you try to figure out on what to do in the future along side with your partners.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[High-quality illustrations].</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The illustrations are drawn in great detail, focusing on the points that you will find appealing. Enjoy what it's like to live with these cute characters!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Intuitive interface to make gaming easier and more enjoyable].</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To make the game as easy and appealing as possible, we've designed the interface to be as intuitive and user-friendly as possible, so you and your roommates can focus on your romance with the characters.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/c9b34c34c6e7765dc449666260f5083d.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/f9b6a85211949e98df84ad6085c2fa5a.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/8b97a52f8c42764e48736f7f3faa5fa2.avif?t=1754563783\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p>",
